    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a robotic arm operator controlling multifunctional mechanical arms through real-time physics simulation in meticulously designed industrial scenarios, tackling high-precision grabbing and placement challenges! In the game, you must master grab-balancing techniques, combine patience with bated breath, and solve increasingly complex engineering puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 Realistic physics control system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 Multiple mechanical arm models</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 The agony of dropped items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with passion by Kuokuo, we hope to bring you joy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a robotic arm operator controlling multifunctional mechanical arms through real-time physics simulation in meticulously designed industrial scenarios, tackling high-precision grabbing and placement challenges! In the game, you must master grab-balancing techniques, combine patience with bated breath, and solve increasingly complex engineering puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 Realistic physics control system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 Multiple mechanical arm models</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 The agony of dropped items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with passion by Kuokuo, we hope to bring you joy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
